        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>去张家界6次整理8千字干货——交通篇</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  background: #ffffff;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n}\n\n.page {\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 719px;\n  margin: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color: #111111;\n  background: #e8edf9;\n}\n\n.banner {\n  height: 65px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  padding: 4px 0 0 18px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  background: #5793df;\n}\n\n.banner-title {\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-size: 36px;\n  line-height: 52px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  letter-spacing: -1.8px;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.25);\n}\n\n.red {\n  color: #f01818;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  height: 46px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding-top: 1px;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #416b61;\n  background: #e8edf9;\n  font-size: 31px;\n  line-height: 42px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.transport-table {\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 608px;\n}\n\n.table-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 38px 502px;\n  width: 540px;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #416b61;\n  background: #e8edf9;\n}\n\n.row-airport {\n  height: 183px;\n}\n\n.row-city {\n  height: 141px;\n}\n\n.row-rental {\n  height: 284px;\n}\n\n.row-label {\n  height: 100%;\n  border-right: 2px solid #416b61;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 27px;\n  line-height: 27px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  white-space: normal;\n}\n\n.row-airport .row-label {\n  padding-top: 7px;\n}\n\n.row-city .row-label {\n  padding-top: 38px;\n}\n\n.row-rental .row-label {\n  padding-top: 38px;\n}\n\n.label-stack {\n  width: 30px;\n}\n\n.row-content {\n  padding: 6px 2px 0 3px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 27px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.row-city .row-content {\n  padding-top: 7px;\n}\n\n.row-rental .row-content {\n  padding-top: 7px;\n}\n\n.text-line {\n  height: 27px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"banner\">\n    <div class=\"banner-title\">去张家界<span class=\"red\">6次</span>整理<span class=\"red\">8千字</span>干货</div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">交通篇（含租车细节）</div>\n\n  <main class=\"transport-table\">\n    <section class=\"table-row row-airport\">\n      <div class=\"row-label\">\n        <div class=\"label-stack\">机<br>场<br>→<br>市<br>区</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row-content\">\n        <div class=\"text-line\">1、<span class=\"red\">机场大巴</span>：实际上是中巴车，写有“张家界机场大酒店”或张家界荷花</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">机场”字样，一般停在机场出口，十几分钟路程，5元到市区的机场大酒店。</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">2、<span class=\"red\">公交车</span>：乘坐4路公交车(8:00-18:00)进入市区，票价1元(无人售票)</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">约0.5小时可到。机场大门口前100m处为4路公交车始发站，此为环城线，</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">为AB线，故建议上车前先向乘务员咨询所去目的地应乘坐路线，及转车地</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">点。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"table-row row-city\">\n      <div class=\"row-label\">\n        <div class=\"label-stack\">市<br>内</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row-content\">\n        <div class=\"text-line\">1、<span class=\"red\">张家界市区内班车</span>：在火车站旁边的汽车站乘坐到武陵源景区或者张家</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">界国家森林公园的线路车，15分钟左右一班，到张家界国家森林公园门票</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">站大约20元/人，车程50分钟左右。</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">2、张家界市区<span class=\"red\">打车</span>到武陵源景区大概100元左右。</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">3、<span class=\"red\">自驾车</span>过去的话，只能停车在门票站外，停车费大概在50元/天。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"table-row row-rental\">\n      <div class=\"row-label\">\n        <div class=\"label-stack\">租<br>车<br>细<br>则</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row-content\">\n        <div class=\"text-line\">1.租车要提前预定，旺季需<span class=\"red\">提前3天</span>预定好</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">2.选靠谱的<span class=\"red\">正规大型平台</span>租车，不考虑小平台</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">3.不管是哪个平台租车都要买好<span class=\"red\">车险</span></div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">4.租车的时候要检查车况，车胎/备胎/刹车/换胎工具/应急工具等等，最好</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">好是拍照/录视频记录一下，车子里程也要拍照留底，一旦发现车子有损坏</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">的地方，立马跟平台说明情况，请求换车处理</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">5.租车平台参考：<span class=\"red\">tb/飞猪/携程/一嗨/神州</span>（自己对比选择）</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">6.价格：一般一天200~300，<span class=\"red\">押金5000</span>，15天后无纠纷原路退回</div>\n        <div class=\"text-line\">7.<span class=\"red\">第一次去不建议租车</span>，不熟悉路况，容易吃罚单也怕事故</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
